			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Oxyopiia/ViceMod/compare/1.0...1.1.0\n\n## Changes\n```diff\n+ Added Mastery Tracker - Oxyopiia\n+ Added Extra Item Info - Oxyopiia\n+ Added Better Warp Menu - Derpy666\n+ Added Cheese Highlight - Oxyopiia\n+ Added Fallen Star Locator - Oxyopiia\n+ Added Fishing Brew Timer - Oxyopiia\n+ Added Diox Boss support - Derpy666\n+ Added Turkinator Invasion Timer - Oxyopiia\n+ Added Cave-In Prediction for other Dynamic Mining areas - Oxyopiia (idea: Derpy666)\n+ Added Adjust Dynamic Mining Bossbars - Derpy666\n+ Added Gore Gauntlet, Starblade, Starbomb, Pillar Items and World 14 items ability support - Oxyopiia/Derpy666\n+ Improved Jynx's Chain Gun volume adjust - Oxyopiia\n+ Improved the /vice command to use sub-commands - Derpy666\n+ Added Pillars Boss Bars - Derpy666\n= Added Event Throttling to the Dev Config - Oxyopiia\n```\n\n## Changes since 1.1-Beta3\n```diff\n+ Added Pillars Boss Bars - Derpy666\n+ Added /vice config\n+ Added Broken Flashlight, Galvaniser and Unstable Dynamite Barrel ability handling - Derpy666\n```\n\n## Bug Fixes since 1.1-Beta3\n```diff\n= Fixed Starblade cooldown - Derpy666\n= Fixed skinned abilities not being detected - Oxyopiia\n= Fixed boss features not working with decimal healths - Oxyopiia\n= Fixed Elderpork Bossbars - Derpy666\n= Fixed Starry Quarry mining area detection - Derpy666\n```\n\n<details>\n    <summary>Technical Changes since 1.1-beta3</summary>\n\n```diff\n= Made Boss Bar detection regexes use named groups instead of index-based grouping\n```\n\n</details>"
